# 🏗️ High Level Architecture

This project follows the **Medallion Architecture** using SQL Server as the data warehouse platform. Data flows from raw source files into the Bronze, Silver, and Gold layers before being consumed by reporting and analytics tools.

---

## Architecture Diagram

```mermaid
flowchart LR

    subgraph Sources
        CRM[📁 CRM]
        ERP[📁 ERP]
        CSV[📄 CSV Files]
    end

    subgraph SQL_Server["SQL Server"]
        subgraph Bronze["🥉 Bronze Layer"]
            B1[(Raw Data)]
        end

        subgraph Silver["🥈 Silver Layer"]
            S1[(Clean & Standardized Data)]
        end

        subgraph Gold["🥇 Gold Layer"]
            G1[(Business-Ready Data)]
        end
    end

    subgraph Consume
        BI[📊 BI & Reporting]
        SQL[🔍 Ad-Hoc SQL Queries]
        ML[🤖 Machine Learning]
    end

    CRM --> B1
    ERP --> B1
    CSV --> B1

    B1 --> S1
    S1 --> G1

    G1 --> BI
    G1 --> SQL
    G1 --> ML
```

